MacLink is distributed under several licenses, depending on the part of the
project. The full license texts are in the LICENSES/ directory.

  Part of the project                          License
  -------------------------------------------  ----------------------------------
  Desktop app   (desktop/)                     GPL-3.0-or-later, with the
  Android app   (android/)                     additional permission in
  CLI           (core/maclink-cli/)            LICENSES/APP-STORE-EXCEPTION.md

  Core libraries (core/, except the CLI):      MPL-2.0
    maclink-core, maclink-protocol,
    maclink-adb, maclink-ffi

  Protocol specification and documentation     CC-BY-4.0
  (docs/)

  Anything not listed above                    GPL-3.0-or-later, with the
                                               additional permission in
                                               LICENSES/APP-STORE-EXCEPTION.md

Individual source files may state their license with an SPDX header, for
example:

  // SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0

When a file's header and this table disagree, the file's header applies.

The MacLink name and logo are covered by the trademark policy in TRADEMARKS.md.

